	// at 0.5× and 1.2×), by its KeyID. A key not in it bills at PriceRate
	// (see key_rate.go).
	KeyPriceRates map[string]float64 `json:"keyPriceRates,omitempty"`
	// TopUpRate is, for a relay built on sub2api, what one of its dollars
